    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI Research Paper Recommendation Assistant.\n\nEvaluate how relevant the following research paper is to the research topic.\n\nResearch Topic:\n{{ $json[\"Research Topic\"] }}\n\nPaper Title:\n{{ $json[\"Title\"] }}\n\nAuthors:\n{{ $json[\"Authors\"] }}\n\nPublished Date:\n{{ $json[\"Published Date\"] }}\n\nEvaluate the paper and provide:\n\n1. Relevance Score: Give a score from 0 to 100.\n2. Recommendation Level: Highly Recommended, Recommended, or Low Relevance.\n3. Recommendation Reason: Briefly explain why this paper is relevant to the research topic.\n4. Potential Use: Explain how this paper could help the researcher.\n\nDo not invent details that cannot reasonably be inferred from the provided paper information.",
